{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C1FLfiACJy8W8RgMDaNKKf","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→Implement the docker-sandbox feature for the Vista plugin, following the 6-phase IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md at .vista/features/docker-sandbox/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md.\n     2→\n     3→Work through ALL phases incrementally. Each phase has a test gate — run the tests and get them GREEN before moving to the next phase:\n     4→\n     5→Phase 1: Settings + Docker SDK Connection\n     6→  - Extend settings.json with sandbox config\n     7→  - Add _SANDBOX_DEFAULTS and get_sandbox_config() to config.py\n     8→  - Create sandbox_errors.py exception hierarchy\n     9→  - Create docker_client.py lazy wrapper\n    10→  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_sandbox_config.py tests/test_docker_client.py -v\n    11→\n    12→Phase 2: Container Lifecycle (TDD)\n    13→  - Create container_manager.py with state machine, MountSpec, ContainerInfo dataclasses\n    14→  - Tests FIRST from TDD diagrams, then implement\n    15→  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_container_manager.py -v\n    16→\n    17→Phase 3: Credential Mounting (TDD)\n    18→  - Create credential_mounter.py with cross-platform path resolution\n    19→  - 15 path resolution tests (3 OS x 5 credentials) from TDD decision tree\n    20→  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_credential_mounter.py -v\n    21→\n    22→Phase 4: Bash Loop Generation (TDD)\n    23→  - Add BASH_LOOP_SCRIPT_TEMPLATE to portable/ralph.py\n    24→  - Create bash_loop_generator.py\n    25→  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_bash_loop_generator.py -v\n    26→\n    27→Phase 5: Docker Integration Tests (requires Docker)\n    28→  - Create docker/Dockerfile from claudebox base\n    29→  - Integration tests with real Docker\n    30→  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/integration/test_docker_sandbox.py -v -m docker\n    31→\n    32→Phase 6: End-to-End Ralph Integration\n    33→  - Extend ralph_service.py create_job() with sandbox param\n    34→  - Extend stop_job() and get_job_status()\n    35→  - Add sandbox param to ralph_start MCP tool\n    36→  - Add /sandbox/status and /sandbox/build API routes\n    37→  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_sandbox_integration.py -v\n    38→\n    39→Read ALL specs at .vista/features/docker-sandbox/specs/*.md and ALL TDD diagrams at .vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-*.mmd before starting.\n    40→\n    41→IMPORTANT: Run tests from the vista/ directory with: python -m pytest tests/... -v\n    42→All test files go under vista/tests/ (not vista/vista/tests/)."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b3360bf-9ca7-4816-8cf1-455a270dc126","uuid":"eba3d9d8-e051-4816-9a53-511ebdfcde99","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista/.vista/ralph/docker-sandbox-build-d23f7244/task.md","content":"Implement the docker-sandbox feature for the Vista plugin, following the 6-phase IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md at .vista/features/docker-sandbox/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md.\n\nWork through ALL phases incrementally. Each phase has a test gate — run the tests and get them GREEN before moving to the next phase:\n\nPhase 1: Settings + Docker SDK Connection\n  - Extend settings.json with sandbox config\n  - Add _SANDBOX_DEFAULTS and get_sandbox_config() to config.py\n  - Create sandbox_errors.py exception hierarchy\n  - Create docker_client.py lazy wrapper\n  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_sandbox_config.py tests/test_docker_client.py -v\n\nPhase 2: Container Lifecycle (TDD)\n  - Create container_manager.py with state machine, MountSpec, ContainerInfo dataclasses\n  - Tests FIRST from TDD diagrams, then implement\n  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_container_manager.py -v\n\nPhase 3: Credential Mounting (TDD)\n  - Create credential_mounter.py with cross-platform path resolution\n  - 15 path resolution tests (3 OS x 5 credentials) from TDD decision tree\n  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_credential_mounter.py -v\n\nPhase 4: Bash Loop Generation (TDD)\n  - Add BASH_LOOP_SCRIPT_TEMPLATE to portable/ralph.py\n  - Create bash_loop_generator.py\n  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_bash_loop_generator.py -v\n\nPhase 5: Docker Integration Tests (requires Docker)\n  - Create docker/Dockerfile from claudebox base\n  - Integration tests with real Docker\n  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/integration/test_docker_sandbox.py -v -m docker\n\nPhase 6: End-to-End Ralph Integration\n  - Extend ralph_service.py create_job() with sandbox param\n  - Extend stop_job() and get_job_status()\n  - Add sandbox param to ralph_start MCP tool\n  - Add /sandbox/status and /sandbox/build API routes\n  - Tests: python -m pytest tests/test_sandbox_integration.py -v\n\nRead ALL specs at .vista/features/docker-sandbox/specs/*.md and ALL TDD diagrams at .vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-*.mmd before starting.\n\nIMPORTANT: Run tests from the vista/ directory with: python -m pytest tests/... -v\nAll test files go under vista/tests/ (not vista/vista/tests/).","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}}}
