{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QeAAFXJnuhUTAtZVK3F4bh","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→stateDiagram-v2\n     2→    %% TDD: ContainerManager State Diagram\n     3→    %% Every transition = testable assertion\n     4→    %% Every missing transition = test that it raises InvalidStateError\n     5→\n     6→    [*] --> Uninitialized: ContainerManager instantiated\n     7→\n     8→    state \"Uninitialized\" as Uninitialized\n     9→    state \"ImageChecking\" as ImageChecking\n    10→    state \"Building\" as Building\n    11→    state \"Creating\" as Creating\n    12→    state \"Starting\" as Starting\n    13→    state \"Running\" as Running\n    14→    state \"Stopping\" as Stopping\n    15→    state \"Removed\" as Removed\n    16→    state \"Expired\" as Expired\n    17→    state \"Failed\" as Failed\n    18→\n    19→    %% Happy path transitions (each labeled with triggering method)\n    20→    Uninitialized --> ImageChecking: ensure_image()\n    21→    ImageChecking --> Creating: image found locally\n    22→    ImageChecking --> Building: image not found\n    23→    Building --> Creating: build_image() succeeds\n    24→    Creating --> Starting: create_container() returns container_id\n    25→    Starting --> Running: start_container() succeeds\n    26→    Running --> Stopping: stop_container() called\n    27→    Stopping --> Removed: auto_remove=true completes\n    28→\n    29→    %% TTL expiry path\n    30→    Running --> Expired: TTL timeout reached\n    31→    Expired --> Removed: force_remove_container()\n    32→\n    33→    %% Error transitions (each with specific error type)\n    34→    ImageChecking --> Failed: DockerNotAvailableError\n    35→    Building --> Failed: ImageBuildError\n    36→    Creating --> Failed: ContainerCreateError\n    37→    Starting --> Failed: ContainerStartError\n    38→    Running --> Failed: ContainerCrashedError\n    39→\n    40→    %% Cleanup from failed state\n    41→    Failed --> Removed: cleanup_failed_container()\n    42→\n    43→    %% Terminal state\n    44→    Removed --> [*]\n    45→\n    46→    note right of Uninitialized\n    47→        Test: reject stop_container()\n    48→        Test: reject start_container()\n    49→        Only ensure_image() valid\n    50→    end note\n    51→\n    52→    note right of Running\n    53→        Test: output.log writable via mount\n    54→        Test: container labels present\n    55→        Test: reject create_container()\n    56→        Test: reject ensure_image()\n    57→    end note\n    58→\n    59→    note right of Failed\n    60→        Test: output.log preserved\n    61→        Test: error type captured\n    62→        Test: container_id still accessible\n    63→        for cleanup\n    64→    end note\n    65→\n    66→    note left of Building\n    67→        Test: progress callback invoked\n    68→        Test: timeout after build_timeout_s\n    69→    end note\n    70→\n    71→    note left of Expired\n    72→        Test: TTL checked periodically\n    73→        Test: force stop issued\n    74→        Test: event logged\n    75→    end note\n    76→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b3360bf-9ca7-4816-8cf1-455a270dc126","uuid":"195f6f14-68ed-478c-bdec-4b70ff27abde","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista/.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-container-manager-states.mmd","content":"stateDiagram-v2\n    %% TDD: ContainerManager State Diagram\n    %% Every transition = testable assertion\n    %% Every missing transition = test that it raises InvalidStateError\n\n    [*] --> Uninitialized: ContainerManager instantiated\n\n    state \"Uninitialized\" as Uninitialized\n    state \"ImageChecking\" as ImageChecking\n    state \"Building\" as Building\n    state \"Creating\" as Creating\n    state \"Starting\" as Starting\n    state \"Running\" as Running\n    state \"Stopping\" as Stopping\n    state \"Removed\" as Removed\n    state \"Expired\" as Expired\n    state \"Failed\" as Failed\n\n    %% Happy path transitions (each labeled with triggering method)\n    Uninitialized --> ImageChecking: ensure_image()\n    ImageChecking --> Creating: image found locally\n    ImageChecking --> Building: image not found\n    Building --> Creating: build_image() succeeds\n    Creating --> Starting: create_container() returns container_id\n    Starting --> Running: start_container() succeeds\n    Running --> Stopping: stop_container() called\n    Stopping --> Removed: auto_remove=true completes\n\n    %% TTL expiry path\n    Running --> Expired: TTL timeout reached\n    Expired --> Removed: force_remove_container()\n\n    %% Error transitions (each with specific error type)\n    ImageChecking --> Failed: DockerNotAvailableError\n    Building --> Failed: ImageBuildError\n    Creating --> Failed: ContainerCreateError\n    Starting --> Failed: ContainerStartError\n    Running --> Failed: ContainerCrashedError\n\n    %% Cleanup from failed state\n    Failed --> Removed: cleanup_failed_container()\n\n    %% Terminal state\n    Removed --> [*]\n\n    note right of Uninitialized\n        Test: reject stop_container()\n        Test: reject start_container()\n        Only ensure_image() valid\n    end note\n\n    note right of Running\n        Test: output.log writable via mount\n        Test: container labels present\n        Test: reject create_container()\n        Test: reject ensure_image()\n    end note\n\n    note right of Failed\n        Test: output.log preserved\n        Test: error type captured\n        Test: container_id still accessible\n        for cleanup\n    end note\n\n    note left of Building\n        Test: progress callback invoked\n        Test: timeout after build_timeout_s\n    end note\n\n    note left of Expired\n        Test: TTL checked periodically\n        Test: force stop issued\n        Test: event logged\n    end note\n","numLines":76,"startLine":1,"totalLines":76}}}
