{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BdZQ9kSHnN1hs2aQkDjJUS","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→flowchart TD\n     2→    %% TDD: BashLoopGenerator.generate() logic flow\n     3→    %% Generates a Linux bash loop script from template\n     4→    %% Mirrors the PowerShell LOOP_SCRIPT_TEMPLATE but for bash\n     5→\n     6→    %% Inputs\n     7→    INPUT_PROVIDER[\"Input: provider: str<br/>'claude' | 'opencode'\"]\n     8→    INPUT_MODEL[\"Input: model: str<br/>e.g. 'opus', 'sonnet'\"]\n     9→    INPUT_MODE[\"Input: mode: str<br/>'plan' | 'build'\"]\n    10→    INPUT_ITERS[\"Input: max_iterations: int<br/>0=unlimited, >0=capped\"]\n    11→    INPUT_FEATURE[\"Input: feature_dir: str<br/>relative path inside container<br/>e.g. '.vista/features/{name}'\"]\n    12→    INPUT_PROJECT[\"Input: project_root: str<br/>'/workspace' (fixed container path)\"]\n    13→    INPUT_JOB_DIR[\"Input: job_dir: str<br/>relative path to job directory<br/>e.g. '.vista/ralph/{job_id}'\"]\n    14→    INPUT_FEATURE_NAME[\"Input: feature_name: str\"]\n    15→\n    16→    INPUT_PROVIDER --> SELECT_PROVIDER\n    17→    INPUT_MODEL --> SUBSTITUTE\n    18→    INPUT_MODE --> VALIDATE_MODE\n    19→    INPUT_ITERS --> VALIDATE_ITERS\n    20→    INPUT_FEATURE --> SUBSTITUTE\n    21→    INPUT_PROJECT --> SUBSTITUTE\n    22→    INPUT_JOB_DIR --> SUBSTITUTE\n    23→    INPUT_FEATURE_NAME --> SUBSTITUTE\n    24→\n    25→    %% Step 1: Validate mode\n    26→    VALIDATE_MODE{mode in<br/>['plan', 'build']?}\n    27→    VALIDATE_MODE -->|No| ERR_MODE[\"Raise ValueError<br/>'Invalid mode: {mode}.<br/>Must be plan or build.'\"]\n    28→    VALIDATE_MODE -->|Yes| VALIDATE_ITERS\n    29→\n    30→    %% Step 2: Validate iterations\n    31→    VALIDATE_ITERS{max_iterations >= 0?}\n    32→    VALIDATE_ITERS -->|No| ERR_ITERS[\"Raise ValueError<br/>'max_iterations must be >= 0,<br/>got {max_iterations}'\"]\n    33→    VALIDATE_ITERS -->|Yes| SELECT_PROVIDER\n    34→\n    35→    %% Step 3: Select provider invocation block\n    36→    SELECT_PROVIDER{provider?}\n    37→    SELECT_PROVIDER -->|\"claude\"| CLAUDE_BLOCK[\"invocation_block =<br/>printf '%s' \\\"$PROMPT_CONTENT\\\" | claude -p \\\\<br/>  --dangerously-skip-permissions \\\\<br/>  --output-format=stream-json \\\\<br/>  --model \\\"$MODEL\\\" \\\\<br/>  --verbose\"]\n    38→    SELECT_PROVIDER -->|\"opencode\"| OPENCODE_BLOCK[\"invocation_block =<br/>opencode run \\\\<br/>  --model \\\"$MODEL\\\" \\\\<br/>  \\\"$PROMPT_CONTENT\\\"\"]\n    39→    SELECT_PROVIDER -->|\"unknown\"| ERR_PROVIDER[\"Raise ValueError<br/>'Unknown provider: {provider}.<br/>Supported: claude, opencode'\"]\n    40→\n    41→    CLAUDE_BLOCK --> SUBSTITUTE\n    42→    OPENCODE_BLOCK --> SUBSTITUTE\n    43→\n    44→    %% Step 4: Template substitution\n    45→    SUBSTITUTE[\"Substitute into BASH_LOOP_TEMPLATE:<br/>  {mode} → mode<br/>  {max_iterations} → max_iterations<br/>  {model} → model<br/>  {feature_name} → feature_name<br/>  {feature_dir_abs} → project_root/feature_dir<br/>  {project_root_abs} → project_root<br/>  {job_dir_abs} → project_root/job_dir<br/>  {provider_name} → provider display name<br/>  {invocation_block} → selected block\"]\n    46→    SUBSTITUTE --> VALIDATE_OUTPUT\n    47→\n    48→    %% Step 5: Validate output\n    49→    VALIDATE_OUTPUT[\"Validate generated script:<br/>  - Starts with #!/bin/bash<br/>  - Contains set -e (fail on error)<br/>  - Has no Windows paths (no backslash paths)<br/>  - Has no PowerShell syntax ($Var, Write-Host)<br/>  - All template placeholders resolved<br/>    (no remaining {.*} patterns)\"]\n    50→    VALIDATE_OUTPUT --> VALID{All checks<br/>pass?}\n    51→    VALID -->|No| ERR_TEMPLATE[\"Raise ScriptGenerationError<br/>'Generated script failed validation:<br/>{specific_check_that_failed}'\"]\n    52→    VALID -->|Yes| OUTPUT\n    53→\n    54→    %% Output\n    55→    OUTPUT[\"Return: str<br/>Complete bash script content<br/>Ready to write to loop.sh\"]\n    56→\n    57→    %% Script structure annotation\n    58→    SCRIPT_STRUCTURE[\"Generated script structure:<br/>1. #!/bin/bash + set -e<br/>2. Variable declarations (MODE, MODEL, etc.)<br/>3. Path setup (FEATURE_DIR, PROJECT_ROOT, etc.)<br/>4. Banner output (echo)<br/>5. Prompt file existence check<br/>6. While loop with iteration counter<br/>7. Prompt composition (task.md + progress.txt)<br/>8. Provider invocation block<br/>9. Exit code check<br/>10. git push<br/>11. Completion check (build mode)<br/>12. Final banner\"]\n    59→    OUTPUT -.-> SCRIPT_STRUCTURE\n    60→\n    61→    %% Styling\n    62→    style INPUT_PROVIDER fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    63→    style INPUT_MODEL fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    64→    style INPUT_MODE fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    65→    style INPUT_ITERS fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    66→    style INPUT_FEATURE fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    67→    style INPUT_PROJECT fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    68→    style INPUT_JOB_DIR fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    69→    style INPUT_FEATURE_NAME fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    70→    style OUTPUT fill:#4a4,color:#fff\n    71→    style ERR_MODE fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    72→    style ERR_ITERS fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    73→    style ERR_PROVIDER fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    74→    style ERR_TEMPLATE fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    75→    style SCRIPT_STRUCTURE fill:#555,color:#fff\n    76→    style CLAUDE_BLOCK fill:#c60,color:#fff\n    77→    style OPENCODE_BLOCK fill:#c60,color:#fff\n    78→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b3360bf-9ca7-4816-8cf1-455a270dc126","uuid":"ab79a00b-d746-49e2-b4c6-07bfac1d88a1","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista/.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-bash-loop-logic.mmd","content":"flowchart TD\n    %% TDD: BashLoopGenerator.generate() logic flow\n    %% Generates a Linux bash loop script from template\n    %% Mirrors the PowerShell LOOP_SCRIPT_TEMPLATE but for bash\n\n    %% Inputs\n    INPUT_PROVIDER[\"Input: provider: str<br/>'claude' | 'opencode'\"]\n    INPUT_MODEL[\"Input: model: str<br/>e.g. 'opus', 'sonnet'\"]\n    INPUT_MODE[\"Input: mode: str<br/>'plan' | 'build'\"]\n    INPUT_ITERS[\"Input: max_iterations: int<br/>0=unlimited, >0=capped\"]\n    INPUT_FEATURE[\"Input: feature_dir: str<br/>relative path inside container<br/>e.g. '.vista/features/{name}'\"]\n    INPUT_PROJECT[\"Input: project_root: str<br/>'/workspace' (fixed container path)\"]\n    INPUT_JOB_DIR[\"Input: job_dir: str<br/>relative path to job directory<br/>e.g. '.vista/ralph/{job_id}'\"]\n    INPUT_FEATURE_NAME[\"Input: feature_name: str\"]\n\n    INPUT_PROVIDER --> SELECT_PROVIDER\n    INPUT_MODEL --> SUBSTITUTE\n    INPUT_MODE --> VALIDATE_MODE\n    INPUT_ITERS --> VALIDATE_ITERS\n    INPUT_FEATURE --> SUBSTITUTE\n    INPUT_PROJECT --> SUBSTITUTE\n    INPUT_JOB_DIR --> SUBSTITUTE\n    INPUT_FEATURE_NAME --> SUBSTITUTE\n\n    %% Step 1: Validate mode\n    VALIDATE_MODE{mode in<br/>['plan', 'build']?}\n    VALIDATE_MODE -->|No| ERR_MODE[\"Raise ValueError<br/>'Invalid mode: {mode}.<br/>Must be plan or build.'\"]\n    VALIDATE_MODE -->|Yes| VALIDATE_ITERS\n\n    %% Step 2: Validate iterations\n    VALIDATE_ITERS{max_iterations >= 0?}\n    VALIDATE_ITERS -->|No| ERR_ITERS[\"Raise ValueError<br/>'max_iterations must be >= 0,<br/>got {max_iterations}'\"]\n    VALIDATE_ITERS -->|Yes| SELECT_PROVIDER\n\n    %% Step 3: Select provider invocation block\n    SELECT_PROVIDER{provider?}\n    SELECT_PROVIDER -->|\"claude\"| CLAUDE_BLOCK[\"invocation_block =<br/>printf '%s' \\\"$PROMPT_CONTENT\\\" | claude -p \\\\<br/>  --dangerously-skip-permissions \\\\<br/>  --output-format=stream-json \\\\<br/>  --model \\\"$MODEL\\\" \\\\<br/>  --verbose\"]\n    SELECT_PROVIDER -->|\"opencode\"| OPENCODE_BLOCK[\"invocation_block =<br/>opencode run \\\\<br/>  --model \\\"$MODEL\\\" \\\\<br/>  \\\"$PROMPT_CONTENT\\\"\"]\n    SELECT_PROVIDER -->|\"unknown\"| ERR_PROVIDER[\"Raise ValueError<br/>'Unknown provider: {provider}.<br/>Supported: claude, opencode'\"]\n\n    CLAUDE_BLOCK --> SUBSTITUTE\n    OPENCODE_BLOCK --> SUBSTITUTE\n\n    %% Step 4: Template substitution\n    SUBSTITUTE[\"Substitute into BASH_LOOP_TEMPLATE:<br/>  {mode} → mode<br/>  {max_iterations} → max_iterations<br/>  {model} → model<br/>  {feature_name} → feature_name<br/>  {feature_dir_abs} → project_root/feature_dir<br/>  {project_root_abs} → project_root<br/>  {job_dir_abs} → project_root/job_dir<br/>  {provider_name} → provider display name<br/>  {invocation_block} → selected block\"]\n    SUBSTITUTE --> VALIDATE_OUTPUT\n\n    %% Step 5: Validate output\n    VALIDATE_OUTPUT[\"Validate generated script:<br/>  - Starts with #!/bin/bash<br/>  - Contains set -e (fail on error)<br/>  - Has no Windows paths (no backslash paths)<br/>  - Has no PowerShell syntax ($Var, Write-Host)<br/>  - All template placeholders resolved<br/>    (no remaining {.*} patterns)\"]\n    VALIDATE_OUTPUT --> VALID{All checks<br/>pass?}\n    VALID -->|No| ERR_TEMPLATE[\"Raise ScriptGenerationError<br/>'Generated script failed validation:<br/>{specific_check_that_failed}'\"]\n    VALID -->|Yes| OUTPUT\n\n    %% Output\n    OUTPUT[\"Return: str<br/>Complete bash script content<br/>Ready to write to loop.sh\"]\n\n    %% Script structure annotation\n    SCRIPT_STRUCTURE[\"Generated script structure:<br/>1. #!/bin/bash + set -e<br/>2. Variable declarations (MODE, MODEL, etc.)<br/>3. Path setup (FEATURE_DIR, PROJECT_ROOT, etc.)<br/>4. Banner output (echo)<br/>5. Prompt file existence check<br/>6. While loop with iteration counter<br/>7. Prompt composition (task.md + progress.txt)<br/>8. Provider invocation block<br/>9. Exit code check<br/>10. git push<br/>11. Completion check (build mode)<br/>12. Final banner\"]\n    OUTPUT -.-> SCRIPT_STRUCTURE\n\n    %% Styling\n    style INPUT_PROVIDER fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style INPUT_MODEL fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style INPUT_MODE fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style INPUT_ITERS fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style INPUT_FEATURE fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style INPUT_PROJECT fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style INPUT_JOB_DIR fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style INPUT_FEATURE_NAME fill:#26c,color:#fff\n    style OUTPUT fill:#4a4,color:#fff\n    style ERR_MODE fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    style ERR_ITERS fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    style ERR_PROVIDER fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    style ERR_TEMPLATE fill:#f44,color:#fff\n    style SCRIPT_STRUCTURE fill:#555,color:#fff\n    style CLAUDE_BLOCK fill:#c60,color:#fff\n    style OPENCODE_BLOCK fill:#c60,color:#fff\n","numLines":78,"startLine":1,"totalLines":78}}}
