{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nAnalysis:\nLet me go through the conversation chronologically to capture all important details.\n\n1. The user's request is a BUILD iteration for the \"docker-sandbox\" feature of the Vista plugin. The task is defined in a task.md file and an IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md with 6 phases (though the plan itself has 9 phases, the task.md specifies 6 phases to implement).\n\n2. I read the task.md, IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md, all 5 spec files, and all 6 TDD diagrams.\n\n3. I read the existing source files: config.py, ralph_service.py, portable/ralph.py, app.py, routes/ralph.py, provider_service.py, and test files.\n\n4. Key discovery: Files are at `vista/vista/` not `vista/` - the project structure has a nested vista directory.\n\n5. I implemented 5 phases so far, with Phase 6 in progress:\n\nPhase 1 (Settings + Data Models) - COMPLETE, 32 tests passing:\n- Created `vista/vista/server/models/__init__.py` \n- Created `vista/vista/server/models/sandbox.py` - MountSpec, CredentialMount, ContainerInfo dataclasses\n- Created `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/__init__.py`\n- Created `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/sandbox_errors.py` - Exception hierarchy\n- Modified `vista/vista/server/config.py` - Added _SANDBOX_DEFAULTS, get_sandbox_settings(), is_sandbox_enabled(), get_sandbox_credential_mounts(), save_sandbox_settings(), validate_sandbox_settings()\n- Created `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/docker_client.py` - Lazy Docker SDK wrapper\n- Created `vista/vista/tests/test_sandbox_config.py` - 22 tests\n- Created `vista/vista/tests/test_docker_client.py` - 10 tests\n\nPhase 2 (Container Manager) - COMPLETE, 22 tests passing:\n- Created `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/container_manager.py` - ContainerManager class\n- Created `vista/vista/tests/test_container_manager.py` - 22 tests\n\nPhase 3 (Credential Mounter) - COMPLETE, 23 tests passing:\n- Created `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/credential_mounter.py` - CredentialMounter class\n- Created `vista/vista/tests/test_credential_mounter.py` - 23 tests\n- ERROR FIX: os.path.join on Windows converts forward slashes to backslashes, breaking Linux/macOS path tests. Fixed by adding `_join_path()` method that uses the separator appropriate to the emulated host OS.\n\nPhase 4 (Bash Loop Generator) - COMPLETE, 24 tests passing:\n- Created `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/bash_loop_generator.py` - BashLoopGenerator class with BASH_LOOP_TEMPLATE\n- Created `vista/vista/tests/test_bash_loop_generator.py` - 24 tests\n- ERROR FIX: Test for \"no backslashes\" was too strict - bash scripts legitimately use `\\` for line continuations. Fixed by only checking for Windows-style paths (C:\\, D:\\).\n\nPhase 5 (Docker Integration) - COMPLETE, 5 integration tests passing:\n- Created `vista/vista/docker/Dockerfile` - debian:bookworm-slim base image\n- Created `vista/vista/docker/.dockerignore`\n- Created `vista/vista/tests/integration/test_docker_sandbox.py` - 5 integration tests\n- ERROR FIX: Integration test used `debian:bookworm-slim` which wasn't pulled locally. Fixed by using `alpine:latest` with auto-pull.\n\nPhase 6 (RalphService Integration) - IN PROGRESS:\n- I had just read the MCP tool location via grep and was about to look at mcp_server.py to understand the ralph_start tool definition\n- Need to: extend ralph_service.py, add sandbox routes, extend MCP tool, write tests\n\nThe last action before the summary request was a grep for `ralph_start` which found it in 7 files, and I was about to read mcp_server.py to understand how to add the sandbox parameter.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user requested a BUILD iteration for the \"docker-sandbox\" feature of the Vista plugin. The task is to implement Docker-based sandboxing for Ralph loop execution across 6 phases defined in `.vista/ralph/docker-sandbox-build-d23f7244/task.md` and `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`. Each phase has a test gate that must pass before moving to the next. The implementation plan covers 9 phases total but the task.md scopes work to 6 phases:\n   - Phase 1: Settings + Docker SDK Connection\n   - Phase 2: Container Lifecycle (TDD)\n   - Phase 3: Credential Mounting (TDD)\n   - Phase 4: Bash Loop Generation (TDD)\n   - Phase 5: Docker Integration Tests (requires Docker)\n   - Phase 6: End-to-End Ralph Integration\n\n   Progress must be tracked in `progress.txt` at the job directory.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Docker-based sandboxing for Ralph agent loops (container-per-loop isolation)\n   - Lazy Docker SDK import pattern (plugin still works without Docker)\n   - TDD approach: write tests first from TDD diagrams, then implement\n   - Credential mount detection across Windows/macOS/Linux with path translation\n   - Bash loop script generation (parallel to existing PowerShell LOOP_SCRIPT_TEMPLATE)\n   - ContainerManager state machine for container lifecycle\n   - CredentialMounter pure logic class (no Docker dependency)\n   - Settings schema with defaults + merge pattern (following existing _RALPH_DEFAULTS pattern)\n   - Exception hierarchy for sandbox errors\n   - Integration tests requiring real Docker daemon\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   **READ - Spec and Architecture Files:**\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md` - Full 9-phase implementation plan with file summary, build order, risk mitigation\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/specs/settings-and-image.md` - DS-F45 through DS-F55, DS-NF10-12\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/specs/credential-management.md` - DS-F12 through DS-F19, DS-NF4-5\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/specs/container-lifecycle.md` - DS-F1 through DS-F11, DS-NF1-3\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/specs/bash-loop-generation.md` - DS-F34 through DS-F44, DS-NF8-9\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/specs/ralph-sandbox-integration.md` - DS-F20 through DS-F33, DS-NF6-7\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-container-manager-states.mmd` - State diagram with transitions\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-container-manager-logic.mmd` - Create-and-start flow\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-credential-mounter-logic.mmd` - get_mounts() flow\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-credential-mounter-decision.mmd` - 3 OS x 5 credentials path resolution\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-sandbox-job-creator-logic.mmd` - Sandbox job creation flow\n   - `.vista/features/docker-sandbox/arch/tdd-bash-loop-logic.mmd` - Bash script generation flow\n\n   **READ - Existing Source Files:**\n   - `vista/vista/server/config.py` - Existing config with _RALPH_DEFAULTS, load_settings(), _merge_dicts(), get_ralph_settings(), save_ralph_settings()\n   - `vista/vista/server/services/ralph_service.py` - RalphService class with create_job(), get_job_status(), stop_job(), _is_process_running()\n   - `vista/vista/portable/ralph.py` - LOOP_SCRIPT_TEMPLATE (PowerShell), Provider imports, standalone CLI\n   - `vista/vista/server/app.py` - FastAPI app with lifespan, routes registration\n   - `vista/vista/server/routes/ralph.py` - Ralph job API endpoints\n   - `vista/vista/server/services/provider_service.py` - Provider abstraction (first 80 lines)\n   - `vista/vista/tests/conftest.py` - Test fixtures (tmp_data_dir, mock_project_dir, patched_config, test_client)\n   - `vista/vista/tests/test_ralph_service.py` - Existing tests with DummyProvider pattern\n\n   **CREATED - Phase 1 Files:**\n   - `vista/vista/server/models/__init__.py` - Empty init\n   - `vista/vista/server/models/sandbox.py` - Data models:\n     ```python\n     @dataclass\n     class MountSpec:\n         host_path: str\n         container_path: str\n         mode: str  # \"rw\" or \"ro\"\n         mount_type: str = \"bind\"\n\n     @dataclass\n     class CredentialMount:\n         name: str\n         host_path: str\n         container_path: str\n         mode: str = \"ro\"\n         is_directory: bool = True\n\n     @dataclass\n     class ContainerInfo:\n         container_id: str\n         name: str\n         job_id: str\n         provider: str\n         status: str\n         image: str = \"\"\n         created_at: str = \"\"\n         expires_at: str = \"\"\n         error: str = \"\"\n     ```\n   - `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/__init__.py` - Package init\n   - `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/sandbox_errors.py` - Exception hierarchy:\n     ```python\n     class SandboxError(Exception)\n     class DockerNotAvailableError(SandboxError)\n     class DockerNotInstalledError(DockerNotAvailableError)\n     class DockerDaemonNotRunningError(DockerNotAvailableError)\n     class ImageBuildError(SandboxError)  # has build_log attribute\n     class ContainerCreateError(SandboxError)\n     class ContainerStartError(SandboxError)\n     class ContainerCrashedError(SandboxError)\n     class InvalidStateError(SandboxError)  # has current_state, attempted_action\n     class MountValidationError(SandboxError)\n     class ScriptGenerationError(SandboxError)\n     ```\n   - `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/docker_client.py` - Lazy Docker wrapper with get_docker_client(), is_docker_available(), reset_client()\n\n   **MODIFIED - Phase 1:**\n   - `vista/vista/server/config.py` - Added after _RALPH_DEFAULTS:\n     ```python\n     _SANDBOX_DEFAULTS = {\n         \"enabled\": False,\n         \"image\": \"vista-ralph:latest\",\n         \"network_enabled\": True,\n         \"ttl_seconds\": 7200,\n         \"credential_mounts\": {\n             \"claude_auth\": {\"enabled\": True},\n             \"git_ssh\": {\"enabled\": True},\n             \"git_config\": {\"enabled\": True},\n             \"gh_cli\": {\"enabled\": True},\n             \"opencode\": {\"enabled\": True},\n         },\n     }\n     ```\n     Added functions: `get_sandbox_settings()`, `is_sandbox_enabled()`, `get_sandbox_credential_mounts()`, `save_sandbox_settings()`, `validate_sandbox_settings()`\n\n   **CREATED - Phase 1 Tests:**\n   - `vista/vista/tests/test_sandbox_config.py` - 22 tests covering defaults, is_sandbox_enabled, credential mounts, save, validation\n   - `vista/vista/tests/test_docker_client.py` - 10 tests covering availability, client caching, error hierarchy\n\n   **CREATED - Phase 2:**\n   - `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/container_manager.py` - ContainerManager class with:\n     - `check_docker_available()` → `(bool, str)`\n     - `ensure_image(image_name, check_only)` → bool\n     - `create_container(job_id, provider, image, mounts, env_vars, network_enabled, ttl_seconds)` → ContainerInfo\n     - `start_container(container_id)`\n     - `stop_container(container_id, remove, timeout)` - idempotent\n     - `exec_in_container(container_id, command, workdir, env)` → `(int, bytes)`\n     - `cleanup_orphans()` → `list[str]` - removes containers from old sessions\n     - `shutdown_all()`\n     - `list_containers()` → `list[ContainerInfo]`\n     - Container naming: `vista-ralph-{job_id[:8]}`\n     - Labels: `managed-by=vista-ralph`, `vista-job-id`, `vista-provider`, `vista-session`\n     - Uses `sleep infinity` command, `/workspace` working dir\n   - `vista/vista/tests/test_container_manager.py` - 22 tests using mock Docker client\n\n   **CREATED - Phase 3:**\n   - `vista/vista/server/services/sandbox/credential_mounter.py` - CredentialMounter with:\n     - `_CREDENTIAL_REGISTRY` list of 5 credential defs (claude_auth, git_ssh, git_config, gh_cli, opencode)\n     - Windows: gh_cli uses `%APPDATA%\\GitHub CLI`, opencode uses `%APPDATA%\\opencode`\n     - Container paths all under `/home/user/`\n     - `_join_path()` method that respects the emulated host OS separator\n     - `get_mounts()` → `list[CredentialMount]` - skips disabled/missing, all mounts are `ro