eation pattern**: Initial attempts to use `Write` on new files failed because they hadn't been read. Learned to use `Bash touch` first, then `Read`, then `Write`.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Established consistent file creation pattern: `Bash touch` → `Read` → `Write`\n   - Cross-platform path handling solved with OS-aware `_join_path()` method\n   - Docker integration tests designed with graceful degradation (skip if Docker unavailable)\n   - All 5 completed phases have green tests: 32 + 22 + 23 + 24 + 5 = 106 tests passing\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - First message: The full BUILD iteration prompt with task description, specifying all 6 phases, the implementation plan path, spec paths, TDD diagram paths, and the requirement to run tests from `vista/` directory.\n   - Second message: \"Your task is to create a detailed summary of the conversation so far...\" (this summary request)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - **Phase 6: End-to-End Ralph Integration** - IN PROGRESS, not yet started coding:\n     - Extend `ralph_service.py` `create_job()` with `sandbox` parameter branching\n     - Extend `stop_job()` and `get_job_status()` for sandboxed jobs\n     - Add `sandbox` parameter to `ralph_start` MCP tool (in `mcp_server.py`)\n     - Create `vista/vista/server/routes/sandbox.py` with `/api/sandbox/status`, `/api/sandbox/settings`, `/api/sandbox/build` endpoints\n     - Write `vista/vista/tests/test_sandbox_integration.py`\n   - Update `progress.txt` at job directory with what changed and test status\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Phase 6 had just begun. The last action was a grep for `ralph_start` across the codebase:\n   ```\n   Found 7 files: vista\\server\\config.py, vista\\server\\services\\provider_service.py, \n   vista\\server\\app.py, vista\\skills\\ralph\\SKILL.md, vista\\mcp_server.py, \n   vista\\tests\\integration\\test_mcp_tools.py, vista\\server\\views\\ralph_jobs.html\n   ```\n   I had read `vista/vista/server/routes/ralph.py` and `vista/vista/server/app.py` and wa