{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015up4z6thbD9GKFrVxRTSSB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DEzAfcf3GwmfcW6eruwP72","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Grove\\OneDrive\\Documents\\PYTHON\\claude_plugins\\vista\\.vista\\ralph\\docker-sandbox-build-d23f7244\\progress.txt","content":"## ITERATION 1 — Docker Sandbox Build\n\n### Phase 1: Settings + Data Models — COMPLETE\n- Created `server/models/sandbox.py` with MountSpec, CredentialMount, ContainerInfo dataclasses\n- Created `server/services/sandbox/sandbox_errors.py` with exception hierarchy\n- Created `server/services/sandbox/docker_client.py` with lazy Docker SDK wrapper\n- Extended `server/config.py` with _SANDBOX_DEFAULTS, get/save/validate sandbox settings\n- Tests: 32 passing (test_sandbox_config.py: 22, test_docker_client.py: 10)\n\n### Phase 2: Container Manager — COMPLETE\n- Created `server/services/sandbox/container_manager.py` with ContainerManager class\n- Full lifecycle: check_docker, ensure_image, create_container, start, stop, exec, cleanup\n- Container naming: `vista-ralph-{job_id[:8]}`, labels for management\n- Tests: 22 passing (test_container_manager.py)\n\n### Phase 3: Credential Mounter — COMPLETE\n- Created `server/services/sandbox/credential_mounter.py` with CredentialMounter class\n- 5 credential types: claude_auth, git_ssh, git_config, gh_cli, opencode\n- Cross-platform path resolution: Windows (APPDATA), macOS, Linux\n- All mounts are read-only; enable/disable per credential\n- Tests: 23 passing (test_credential_mounter.py)\n\n### Phase 4: Bash Loop Generator — COMPLETE\n- Created `server/services/sandbox/bash_loop_generator.py` with BashLoopGenerator class\n- BASH_LOOP_TEMPLATE with Claude and OpenCode invocation blocks\n- Generates container-native bash scripts with /workspace paths\n- Tests: 24 passing (test_bash_loop_generator.py)\n\n### Phase 5: Docker Integration — COMPLETE\n- Created `docker/D